                        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 15px; line-height: 1.5;">Define how incoming live traffic should be balanced during the staging phase.</p>
                        
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><input type="radio" name="ab_mode" id="radio_ab_none" checked onchange="toggleABWrappers()"> No A/B Routing (Standard Cutover)</label>
                            <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><input type="radio" name="ab_mode" id="radio_ab_native" onchange="toggleABWrappers()"> Option 1: Append to Existing OSPC Load Balancer (Recommended)</label>
                            <label style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><input type="radio" name="ab_mode" id="radio_ab_haproxy" onchange="toggleABWrappers()"> Option 2: Inject inline HAProxy Proxy Server</label>
