                        <div id="ab-opt2-wrapper" style="display: none; animation: slideUp 0.3s forwards; padding-left: 20px; border-left: 2px solid #ef4444; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                            <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #ef4444; margin-top: -5px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Warning: This modifies source infrastructure by installing <code>haproxy</code>.</p>
                            <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><label>Target OSPC Proxy Host IP</label><input type="text" id="ab_haproxy_ip" placeholder="e.g. 10.50.1.10"></div>
                            <div class="form-group"><label>HAProxy Binding Port</label><input type="number" id="ab_haproxy_port" value="80"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="section-title"><div class="section-title-wrapper">Advanced SSH Routing</div></h2>
                    <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #94a3b8; font-style: italic; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.5;">If your Cloud nodes are locked inside a Private VPC without public IPs, providing a Jump Host (e.g. <code style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 4px;">user@10.0.0.5</code>) automatically constructs secure nested <code>ssh -J</code> proxy tunnels. Optional Rsync bandwidth limits (KB/s) can be set for peak-hour transfers.</p>
                    <div class="form-group"><label>OSPC Jump Host (Optional)</label><input type="text" id="ospc_jump_host" placeholder="e.g. juser@10.0.0.5"></div>
                    <div class="form-group"><label>FLEX Jump Host (Optional)</label><input type="text" id="flex_jump_host" placeholder="e.g. bastion@10.60.0.5"></div>
                    <div class="form-group"><label>Rsync Bandwidth Limit (KB/s, 0=unlimited)</label><input type="number" id="rsync_bwlimit" value="0"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="btn-wrapper">
                <button type="button" id="generate-btn">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
                    Generate DATA Migration Script
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </form>

    <div class="panel output-panel" id="output-container">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="justify-content: space-between;">
            <div class="section-title-wrapper">Stage 2: Generated Bash Script</div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                <button class="secondary" id="copy-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Copy</button>
                <button class="secondary" id="download-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Download .sh</button>
                <button type="button" class="secondary" id="execute-btn" style="padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 0.9rem; border-color: var(--primary); color: var(--primary);">🚀 Execute Script</button>
