            </div>
        </h2>
        <pre><code id="script-output"></code></pre>
    </div>
    
    <div class="panel output-panel" id="execution-logs-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 30px; border-color: var(--primary);">
        <h2 class="section-title">Stage 2: Execution Logs <span id="exec-spinner" style="font-size: 0.8rem; margin-left: 10px; color: var(--primary);">Tracking via API...</span></h2>
        <pre><code id="live-logs" style="color: #a5d6ff;">Terminal starting...</code></pre>
    </div>
    
    <div class="panel output-panel" id="results-table-container" style="display: none; margin-top: 30px; border-color: var(--secondary);">
        <h2 class="section-title">
            <div class="section-title-wrapper">Stage 2: Live Migration Results</div>
            <button type="button" class="secondary" id="export-csv-btn" style="padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 0.9rem;">💾 Export CSV</button>
        </h2>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
            <table class="grid-table" style="width: 100%; text-align: left; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);">
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Component</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Target IP</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Dependencies Required</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Dep Status</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">App Data Source -> Target</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Data Status</th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 5px; color: var(--text-muted);">Error</th>
